1
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:08,675
Huh

2
00:00:09,675 --> 00:00:12,214
That thing... is coming with me

3
00:00:31,973 --> 00:00:34,179
You awoke sooner than I thought

4
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,092
The curse of immortality is stubborn

5
00:00:38,538 --> 00:00:40,849
Unable to enter the Ley Lines

6
00:00:40,849 --> 00:00:43,354
Yet not content to remain a spirit

7
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:48,266
Ruler of Death... What do you want?

8
00:00:50,187 --> 00:00:54,865
You perplex me. Both you... and you

9
00:00:56,237 --> 00:00:59,057
That thing may be a creation of Celestia

10
00:00:59,107 --> 00:01:03,383
But it possesses none of Celestia's power, let alone authority

11
00:01:03,799 --> 00:01:06,246
Your obsession with it baffles me

12
00:01:08,233 --> 00:01:10,898
No matter. The resurrection will soon begin

13
00:01:11,982 --> 00:01:15,975
It's worthless, anyway... I'll reclaim it next time

14
00:01:25,338 --> 00:01:25,895
Hey

15
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:29,907
Who says... there'll be a next time?

16
00:03:06,305 --> 00:03:08,126
...Traveler?

